    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d629">

                <pb facs="0751" n="666" sameAs="frus:frus1919v02/pg666"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">417.41/13</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The British Embassy to the
                            Department of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#float-left">No. 519</seg></opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum</hi></p>
                <p>The British Embassy present their compliments to the Department of State and have
                    the honour to refer to the Department’s memorandum of April 30th,<anchor n="10"
                        xml:id="d629-f1"/> in which it was stated that the Public <pb facs="0752"
                        n="667" xml:id="pg667"/> Credit Commission in Nicaragua had agreed to
                    increase its offer for the settlement of the British claims to a total of
                    £9000.0.0. cash and £2000.0.0. bonds.</p>
                <p>This offer was communicated by telegram to the British Government, from whom a
                    reply has now been received expressing their regret that they are unable to
                    accept the offer.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1918-05-14">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 14, 1918</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
